<p>Dutch authorities have recovered the Coțofenești helmet, a 2,500-year-old gold artifact from Romania, more than a year after thieves stole it from the Drents Museum in Assen in January 2025. Prosecutors unveiled the helmet in Assen on Thursday. The artifact is tied to the ancient Dacian civilization and is widely seen as a Romanian cultural icon. The recovery is a hopeful turn in a case that had raised fears the object might be lost for good, including worries that thieves could melt it down because it was too famous to sell openly. Authorities said they made the breakthrough through a plea arrangement involving suspects in the theft, who used explosive force during the museum break-in.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/aKCPqFYeyTiZepemAipB6NXr9KSWfWXZY256wHeQR6qT7wsrASnmoH50VJ2yoMdXdGiEYBf0wkG9b8Ogf0L0ngdY01pOaxgGzBddObrIhioObUOCcWgpyD2K4mddxMnSCKW1HGyRyI2hvhSmvNZ2ZCKzU7Xh06gPUOFfsMu3A14gRG6gIe2Fbg' alt='The recovered golden helmet of Cotofenesti and two gold bracelets on display in the Netherlands on Thursday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Recovered haul: Reports said the thieves also took gold bracelets along with the helmet, suggesting the heist targeted several Romanian antiquities rather than a single showpiece.</li><li>Public display: Prosecutors unveiled the artifacts under heavy security, with police in balaclavas guarding the presentation in the eastern Dutch city of Assen.</li><li>Break-in tools: PBS said the thieves used a homemade bomb and a sledgehammer to get into the museum, underscoring the force behind the theft.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/apr/02/stolen-romanian-gold-helmet-recovered-netherlands'>‘A wow moment’: ancient Romanian gold helmet returned in plea deal with theft suspects</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/stolen-golden-helmet-found-dutch-art-detective-says/'>Ancient golden helmet found year after it was stolen from museum</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/arts/a-priceless-romanian-helmet-is-recovered-after-thieves-broke-in-with-a-homemade-bomb-and-sledgehammer'>A priceless Romanian helmet is recovered after thieves broke in with a homemade bomb and sledgehammer</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/02/world/europe/museum-heist-netherlands-helmet-romania.html'>Ancient Artifacts Stolen in Dutch Museum Heist Are Recovered</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ctvnews.ca/world/article/stolen-romanian-golden-helmet-found-dutch-art-sleuth-to-afp/'>Dutch authorities recover the Helmet of Coțofenești and other treasures from the Dacian royal collection, which were stolen from the Drents Museum in Assen, Drenthe, in 2025.</a> - ctvnews.ca</li></ul>